OL,3,GNEWSAYouth hub hailed a hit in reducing
OL,4,Atrouble as 'the kids need fun'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Anton Noble thinks of his work as
OL,7,Fa youth worker and how to keep
OL,8,Fyoungsters out of trouble, one thing
OL,9,Fcomes to mind.
OL,11,F"The kids need fun. They need it in
OL,12,Ftheir life. And as adults and youth
OL,13,Fworkers and mentors, we are there to
OL,14,Fencourage that," he said.
OL,16,FHe is also the founder of the youth
OL,17,Fcharity Guiding Young Minds and they
OL,18,Frecently set up this youth hub in a
OL,19,Fformer shop in the centre of Rugby,
OL,20,FWarwickshire.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
