OL,3,GNEWSAYouth hub hailed a hit in reducing
OL,4,Atrouble as 'the kids need fun'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe effort was a collaboration with
OL,7,Fgroups including the local council and
OL,8,Fpolice, as part of attempts to cut
OL,9,Fanti-social behaviour in the area.
